B.asN=new A.Qa("nextcloud","files","Nextcloud Setup","Connect your Nextcloud instance, including self-hosted servers. NeoAgent opens Nextcloud's own login page so you can sign in with password, SSO, or 2FA.","Use a Nextcloud URL the NeoAgent server can reach, for example https://cloud.example.com.","Nextcloud Login Flow","Connected Nextcloud User","Nextcloud URL","https://cloud.example.com","Cloud and self-hosted instances are supported. Local and private-network URLs work when NeoAgent can reach them.","Nextcloud URL is required.","Could not save Nextcloud setup.","Disconnect Nextcloud?","This removes the Nextcloud URL and all connected Nextcloud accounts for this agent.","Could not disconnect Nextcloud.",!0)
B.asO=new A.Qa("neorecall","recall","NeoRecall Setup","Connect your self-hosted NeoRecall server. NeoAgent receives read-only access to local search, memories, and transcript evidence after you approve the OAuth screen.","Use a NeoRecall URL the NeoAgent server can reach. NeoAgent's PUBLIC_URL must also be reachable from this browser for the OAuth callback.","OAuth with PKCE","Connected NeoRecall User","NeoRecall Backend URL","https://recall.example.com","Local and private-network URLs are supported when the NeoAgent server can reach them. Audio is never exposed to NeoAgent.","NeoRecall backend URL is required.","Could not save NeoRecall setup.","Disconnect NeoRecall?","This removes the NeoRecall backend URL and all connected NeoRecall accounts for this agent.","Could not disconnect NeoRecall.",!0)
B.asP=new A.Qa("neoarchive","archive","NeoArchive Setup","Add the NeoArchive backend URL once. NeoAgent will open NeoArchive OAuth so the user can sign in and approve archive access without API keys.",null,"OAuth companion flow","Connected NeoArchive User","NeoArchive Backend URL","https://archive.example.com","Use the public base URL of the NeoArchive server. Local self-hosted URLs are supported when NeoAgent can reach them.","NeoArchive backend URL is required.","Could not save NeoArchive setup.","Disconnect NeoArchive?","This removes the NeoArchive backend URL and all connected NeoArchive accounts for this agent.","Could not disconnect NeoArchive.",!1)
